{
  "$schema": "../../scenario.schema.json",
  "id": "orchestration/a-loop-revises-its-output-until-its-reviewer-approves",
  "title": "A Loop takes its producer's turn: the producer's task and the reviewer's review run in child rooms, a rejection's feedback goes back to the producer, and the approved output answers the message one deeper, saying how the loop ended",
  "rules": [
    "§19.7.4",
    "§23.3"
  ],
  "notes": "Python: tests/orchestration/test_loop_strategy.py TestExecuteLoop::test_revision_cycle, test_all_reviewers_approve, test_updates_room_state, TestRunLoop::test_run_loop_returns_output, TestLoopInstall::test_install_registers_reviewers, test_install_sets_initial_state; test_strategy_loop.py TestLoopInstall::test_registers_reviewer_on_kit; test_loop_producer_cut.py test_a_completed_loop_says_how_the_producers_last_turn_ended (the record is the producer's last turn's, its usage the second draft's); test_strategy_loop.py TestLoopInstall::test_sets_initial_state; test_loop_review_status.py (approves, asks-for-revision). orchestration/strategies/loop.py: _execute_loop, _review_prompt, _revision_prompt, _review_ended; _worker_run.py run_worker. The reviewer is registered, never attached; each task's status entries are the worker run's (task_run), the terminal one naming its task. Neither agent is given a handoff or an approval tool (test_strategy_loop.py TestLoopInstall::test_no_handoff_tools_injected).",
  "setup": {
    "channels": [
      {
        "id": "sms",
        "type": "sms",
        "category": "transport"
      },
      {
        "id": "writer",
        "type": "ai",
        "agent": {
          "role": "Writer"
        },
        "model": {
          "rounds": [
            {
              "text": "Draft one.",
              "usage": {
                "input_tokens": 3,
                "output_tokens": 1
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "Draft two.",
              "usage": {
                "input_tokens": 3,
                "output_tokens": 2
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "editor",
        "type": "ai",
        "agent": {
          "role": "Editor"
        },
        "model": {
          "rounds": [
            {
              "text": "Needs work."
            },
            {
              "text": "APPROVED"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
    "rooms": [
      {
        "id": "r1",
        "bindings": [
          {
            "channel_id": "sms"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "strategies": [
      {
        "id": "loop",
        "loop": {
          "agent": "writer",
          "reviewer": "editor"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "call": "install_strategy",
      "room_id": "r1",
      "strategy": "loop"
    },
    {
      "call": "process_inbound",
      "room_id": "r1",
      "message": {
        "channel_id": "sms",
        "sender_id": "u1",
        "content": {
          "type": "text",
          "body": "Write it."
        }
      },
      "expect": {
        "result": {
          "blocked": false,
          "error": null,
          "response_metadata": {
            "turns": {
              "writer": {
                "loop_end_reason": "completed",
                "ai_usage": {
                  "output_tokens": 2
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "idle": true
    },
    {
      "call": "status.recent",
      "agent_id": "writer",
      "expect": {
        "result": [
          {
            "agent_id": "writer",
            "action": "iteration",
            "status": "pending",
            "detail": "Write it.",
            "metadata": {
              "room_id": "r1",
              "role": "producer",
              "iteration": 1,
              "max_iterations": 3,
              "task_run": true,
              "task_id": {
                "$absent": true
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "agent_id": "writer",
            "action": "iteration",
            "status": "completed",
            "detail": "Draft one.",
            "metadata": {
              "room_id": "r1",
              "role": "producer",
              "iteration": 1,
              "max_iterations": 3,
              "task_run": true,
              "task_id": {
                "$present": true
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "agent_id": "writer",
            "action": "iteration",
            "status": "pending",
            "detail": "Revise your previous work based on the reviewers' feedback. Your previous output and their feedback are set apart below.\n\n[Your previous output]\n<worker_output>\nDraft…",
            "metadata": {
              "room_id": "r1",
              "role": "producer",
              "iteration": 2,
              "max_iterations": 3,
              "task_run": true,
              "task_id": {
                "$absent": true
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "agent_id": "writer",
            "action": "iteration",
            "status": "completed",
            "detail": "Draft two.",
            "metadata": {
              "room_id": "r1",
              "role": "producer",
              "iteration": 2,
              "max_iterations": 3,
              "task_run": true,
              "task_id": {
                "$present": true
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "call": "status.recent",
      "agent_id": "editor",
      "expect": {
        "result": [
          {
            "agent_id": "editor",
            "action": "review",
            "status": "pending",
            "detail": "Review the following content and decide if it meets quality standards.\nIf approved, your response MUST contain the word APPROVED.\nIf not approved, provide specific feedback for revision.\n\nThe…",
            "metadata": {
              "room_id": "r1",
              "role": "reviewer",
              "strategy": "sequential",
              "task_run": true,
              "approved": {
                "$absent": true
              },
              "task_id": {
                "$absent": true
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "agent_id": "editor",
            "action": "review",
            "status": "info",
            "detail": "Needs work.",
            "metadata": {
              "room_id": "r1",
              "role": "reviewer",
              "strategy": "sequential",
              "task_run": true,
              "approved": false,
              "task_id": {
                "$present": true
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "agent_id": "editor",
            "action": "review",
            "status": "pending",
            "detail": "Review the following content and decide if it meets quality standards.\nIf approved, your response MUST contain the word APPROVED.\nIf not approved, provide specific feedback for revision.\n\nThe…",
            "metadata": {
              "room_id": "r1",
              "role": "reviewer",
              "strategy": "sequential",
              "task_run": true,
              "approved": {
                "$absent": true
              },
              "task_id": {
                "$absent": true
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "agent_id": "editor",
            "action": "review",
            "status": "completed",
            "detail": "APPROVED",
            "metadata": {
              "room_id": "r1",
              "role": "reviewer",
              "strategy": "sequential",
              "task_run": true,
              "approved": true,
              "task_id": {
                "$present": true
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
